<section class="intro">
  <h2>Prepare, Study, and Write a Biblical Sermon</h2>

  <p>
    This section is designed to teach you how to prepare a sermon from Scripture.
    It is not simply a sermon generator.
  </p>

  <p>
    The goal is to help you learn how to study the Bible carefully,
    understand the passage, organize what you discover, and communicate
    the truth of Scripture clearly.
  </p>

  <div class="notice">
    <strong>Important:</strong>
    AI and study tools can assist your preparation, but they should never
    replace Scripture, prayer, careful study, or your responsibility to
    handle God's Word accurately.
  </div>
</section>


